  "articleHtml": "<main>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.di3p72b6ujm6\">\n<span>\n     Jersey Mike\u2019s Calories Calculator\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     At Jersey Mike\u2019s, the sandwich name alone is not enough to calculate nutrition accurately.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A Mini Turkey and Provolone, a Regular Turkey and Provolone, and a Giant Turkey and Provolone are different servings. Turning the same recipe into a Sub Bowl or Wrap changes the meal again. Then there is Mike\u2019s Way, cheese, mayo, hot chopped pepper relish, extra meat, and other customizations.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Jersey Mike\u2019s Calories Calculator above\n    </span>\n<span>\n     to match the sub, serving format, size, and extras you actually order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.8fdvsa6wrt0q\">\n<span>\n     Size Should Be the First Choice\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Jersey Mike\u2019s uses distinct portion sizes rather than one universal sub serving.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The main size structure includes:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Mini\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Regular\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Giant\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The nutrition of a Giant should never be displayed as though it were the same serving as a Regular.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Larger subs contain more bread, meat, cheese, and other ingredients, so calories, protein, carbs, fat, and sodium can increase substantially.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     When comparing two sandwiches, make sure you are comparing the same size first.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.mat9w5i77fd4\">\n<span>\n     Mike\u2019s Way Is Part of the Recipe\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Jersey Mike\u2019s is especially known for ordering subs\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Mike\u2019s Way\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That preparation includes:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Onions\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Lettuce\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Tomatoes\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Olive oil blend\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Red wine vinegar\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Spices\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     These ingredients should be considered when interpreting the nutrition for a standard Mike\u2019s Way cold sub.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The vegetables contribute relatively little energy, while the oil portion can make a much more noticeable difference to calories and fat.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you remove the oil or another Mike\u2019s Way component, your customized sandwich may differ from the standard published recipe.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.r0fuj8ih3q9x\">\n<span>\n     Cold Subs and Hot Subs Need Different Logic\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Jersey Mike\u2019s divides its menu into cold and hot subs.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cold subs include combinations of sliced meats, cheeses, tuna, vegetables, and Mike\u2019s Way ingredients.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Hot subs include cheesesteak-style sandwiches with grilled steak or chicken, peppers, onions, mushrooms, cheese, bacon, ranch, chipotle sauce, or other ingredients depending on the recipe.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A Mike\u2019s Famous Philly therefore should not be calculated from the nutrition of a cold roast beef sub simply because both contain beef.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the exact sandwich recipe.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.5fn7yvh0fp3x\">\n<span>\n     The Original Italian Combines Several Meats\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The Original Italian is one of Jersey Mike\u2019s most recognizable cold subs.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     It combines multiple Italian-style meats with provolone rather than using one single protein.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That means its nutrition reflects the full combination of meat, cheese, bread, and standard toppings.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     It should not be estimated by taking a ham sandwich and adding one generic serving of salami.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The same principle applies to combination subs such as:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Jersey Shore\u2019s Favorite\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The Number Four\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The Super Sub\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Stickball Special\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cancro Special\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Club Sub\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     and\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Club Supreme\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Each should have its own verified recipe and serving size.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.2o5r0v7a1qx5\">\n<span>\n     Club Subs Need Bacon and Mayo Counted Correctly\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Club-style sandwiches can include ingredients such as turkey, ham, roast beef, bacon, cheese, and mayo.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     These additions can make their nutrition substantially different from a simpler turkey or ham sub.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If bacon and mayo are already included in the standard Club Sub nutrition, do not add them again.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you request extra bacon, extra cheese, or additional mayo, then the extra portion should be added separately when verified nutrition is available.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.1tv39im1njnq\">\n<span>\n     Cheesesteaks Can Be High in Protein and Sodium\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Jersey Mike\u2019s hot subs include steak and chicken cheesesteak-style sandwiches.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Current NutritionSolver records include items such as:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Mike\u2019s Famous Philly\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Mike\u2019s Chicken Philly\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chipotle Cheese Steak\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chipotle Chicken Cheese Steak\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Big Kahuna Cheese Steak\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Big Kahuna Chicken Cheese Steak\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Buffalo Chicken Cheese Steak\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     and\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bacon Ranch Chicken Cheese Steak\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     These sandwiches can provide substantial protein, but cheese, sauces, seasoning, bread, and larger meat portions can also contribute considerable calories and sodium.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A high-protein value should therefore be viewed alongside the complete nutrition profile.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.8o1x4rwh0i7q\">\n<span>\n     Buffalo and Ranch Preparations Need Their Own Records\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Adding Buffalo sauce, ranch, bacon, chipotle sauce, or other richer ingredients can change more than the flavor.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The standard hot sub and the flavored version should remain separate nutrition entries.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chicken Philly\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     and\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Buffalo Chicken Cheese Steak\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     are different recipes.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Likewise:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Chicken Philly\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     and\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bacon Ranch Chicken Cheese Steak\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     should not share one nutrition total.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This is especially important for sodium and fat.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.kwgqlltv4qmg\">\n<span>\n     A Sub Bowl Is Not Just a Sub With the Bread Hidden\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Jersey Mike\u2019s officially recognizes\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Sub Bowls\n    </span>\n<span>\n     as a separate serving format.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Removing the bread can substantially reduce the carbohydrate contribution, but the meat, cheese, oil, sauces, vegetables, and other toppings remain.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A Sub Bowl should therefore have its own calculated recipe.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     It should not be displayed as:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Regular sub calories minus an estimated bread value\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     unless the calculation is explicitly derived from verified ingredient data.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The better approach is to use the restaurant\u2019s own nutrition for that exact Sub Bowl configuration.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.r6qkkvk2tv32\">\n<span>\n     Wraps Need Their Own Serving Format Too\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Jersey Mike\u2019s also recognizes wraps as a Regular-equivalent ordering format.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A tortilla and a sub roll are different products with different nutrition.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The calculator should therefore let users select the format rather than applying the Regular sub nutrition to a wrap automatically.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A strong ordering sequence would be:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Choose sub \u2192 Choose format \u2192 Choose size where applicable \u2192 Customize\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.gqzya0oljn4x\">\n<span>\n     Bread Choice Should Be Visible\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Jersey Mike\u2019s breads are part of the nutrition calculation.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The restaurant also notes that cornmeal is used during the bread baking process.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Where different bread choices are available, NutritionSolver should identify them explicitly rather than leaving the bread hidden inside a generic sandwich record.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This is particularly important for users comparing carbs or allergens.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.r7nh2219bbq6\">\n<span>\n     Extra Meat Changes Protein and More\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Adding extra meat can raise the amount of protein in a sub, but it also changes calories, sodium, cholesterol, and fat depending on the meat.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The same applies to extra cheese.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A calculator should ideally allow:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Standard meat\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Extra meat\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Extra cheese\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     as clearly labeled options when verified ingredient nutrition is available.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Do not estimate an extra-meat sandwich by simply doubling the entire sub.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Only the added ingredient portion should change.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.c9yrx9572xip\">\n<span>\n     Tuna Is Nutritionally Different From Deli Meat Subs\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Jersey Mike\u2019s Tuna Fish sub should be treated as a separate sandwich type.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Tuna salad contains additional ingredients beyond plain tuna, so its calories and fat profile can differ substantially from turkey, ham, or roast beef.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the finished tuna recipe rather than applying plain canned tuna nutrition to the sandwich.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.oltoexox2w5f\">\n<span>\n     The Veggie Still Includes More Than Vegetables\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A Veggie sub is not simply lettuce and tomato on bread.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cheese, bread, oil, vinegar, and other selected ingredients can contribute substantial calories and fat.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That is why a vegetarian sandwich can still have a significant calorie total.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The menu label tells you whether meat is included. It does not tell you whether the complete sandwich is low in calories.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.x4jsyiy99k9o\">\n<span>\n     Breakfast Availability Can Vary by Location\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Some Jersey Mike\u2019s locations offer breakfast sandwiches.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Jersey Mike\u2019s rewards information specifically recognizes breakfast sandwiches where available, which means breakfast should not be treated as a universal nationwide menu category.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If NutritionSolver keeps breakfast records, label them:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Available at select locations\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     rather than presenting them as standard at every Jersey Mike\u2019s restaurant.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.qsar14sff1dx\">\n<span>\n     Chips, Cookies, and Brownies Belong in the Meal\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Jersey Mike\u2019s sells sides and desserts separately from the sandwich.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A typical order might be:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Regular sub + chips + fountain drink\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     or:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Mini sub + cookie + drink\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For a complete calculation, each component should be added individually.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The calories for the sandwich alone do not represent the entire meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.jsb4rrorena0\">\n<span>\n     Generic Drinks Should Not Have One Fixed Nutrition Value\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A bottled or fountain drink can range from a zero-calorie beverage to a sugar-sweetened drink containing hundreds of calories.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If the exact beverage is not specified, NutritionSolver should not use one universal value.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A better display is:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Calories vary by beverage selection\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     until the customer chooses the actual drink and size.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.5v4z9ozf8a4p\">\n<span>\n     Jersey Mike\u2019s Nutrition Questions\n    </span>\n</h2><div class=\"faq-accordion-container space-y-3 my-6\"><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in a Jersey Mike\u2019s sub?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>What does Mike\u2019s Way mean?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>What sizes does Jersey Mike\u2019s offer?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Is a Sub Bowl lower in carbs than a regular sub?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Are Jersey Mike\u2019s cheesesteaks high in protein?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Are chips included in Jersey Mike\u2019s sandwich calories?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Does Jersey Mike\u2019s nutrition change with customization?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details></div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.mbc9nokaabh8\">\n<span>\n     Calculate the Jersey Mike\u2019s Order You Actually Eat\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Start with the exact\n    </span>\n<span>\n     cold or hot sub\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Then select the correct\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Mini, Regular, Giant, Sub Bowl, or Wrap format\n    </span>\n<span>\n     and account for whether you order it\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Mike\u2019s Way\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     After that, include any\n    </span>\n<span>\n     extra meat, cheese, mayo, sauce, relish, chips, dessert, or drink\n    </span>\n<span>\n     that differs from the standard recipe.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That structure gives you a much more useful Jersey Mike\u2019s nutrition result than assigning one calorie number to every version of the same sandwich.\n    </span>\n</p>\n</main>",
  "seoTitle": "Jersey Mike\u2019s Calories Calculator: Nutrition & Macros",
  "seoDescription": "Calculate Jersey Mike\u2019s calories, protein, carbs, fat, and sodium for cold subs, cheesesteaks, Mini, Regular and Giant sizes, Sub Bowls, wraps, toppings, and sides."
}